  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Kids Ranger Vest is perfect for young adventurers, modeled after the adult version. It's great for airsoft, costumes, or daily wear. The vest features a multitude of pockets, including 8 front pockets for storing various items. Additionally, it comes with a rear hook and loop game bag, epaulets, and shell loops, offering an authentic look and feel. The zippered collar with a concealed hood adds versatility and functionality to this outdoor essential, ensuring your child is prepared for any adventure.</p>",
